Z||000009||PAUL88GT||12-21-1999||06:40 PM||||Cutter:<P>What was the cost of replacing the CAT?  Also, what are the symtoms when the CAT is bad? I don't know if I have power loss since I have only owned a v6 Fiero for a couple of months. TIA.||||reg||5
Z||000010||Carrolles||12-22-1999||07:19 AM||||Meineke Muffler Shop replaced mine with a hi flow cat for around $190.00 US two years ago.<P>The guts blew out of mine and resonated very loudly.  It sounded great for about five minutes.  Then is was just annoying.||||reg||1
Z||000011||dogtired||12-22-1999||05:14 PM||||PAUL88GT, had bad CATs on both my V6s and the way they acted were different?<BR>The 86GT just rattled when you started it, I didn't notice it going down the road, usually stopped somewhat when I pulled it into gear. It is an automatic.<BR>Now on the 87SE, I had just rebuilt (totally) the motor, got it started and adjusted timming and everything else you do to a new motor. It really sounded great,    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> sitting in the drive. Took it for first test drive, step down on the accelerator and wouldn't get much response,   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> you could hear a sort of wind noise, and my SEAT of the Pants meter said it just wasn't doing what it should. I purchased the car with a blown motor so had no clue the CAT was bad. So there you have it, MY Symptoms. So what did I do? I am glad you asked. On the 87SE I cut out the cat and replaced it with 21" pipe. On the 86GT a friend and I gutted the cat and put it back on.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> I like the way the sound.<BR>Forgot to add, See "Please Help!!!!!" that is where this particular thread started, and it offers some other thoughts on CAT's.<p>[This message has been edited by dogtired (edited 12-22-1999).]||||reg||6
Z||000012||CUTTER||12-22-1999||10:42 PM||||Well the symptoms are...<BR>1. Loosing power<BR>2. rattling or wistling sound<BR>3. exhaust gets quieter<BR>4. smoke from the exhaust pipe<BR>5. The smell of exhaust but 5 times worse<P>what happend to me when my CAT. went bad was 1,3,4,and 5. Some people say it rattles or whistes but it didnt happen to me. I forget what it cost, I think around 140-150 US, and thats with towing.<BR>CUTTER<p>[This message has been edited by CUTTER (edited 12-22-1999).]||||reg||1
